Vulkan API headers of the Khronos Group, version 1.4.328, unchanged:
vulkan_core.h, vk_platform.h and the vk_video headers vulkan_core.h
includes. They are here because the add-on finds the Vulkan loader at run
time and the Haiku build has no Vulkan package to take them from.

