SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 OR MIT

The headers name Apache-2.0; Khronos publishes them under either licence
(https://github.com/KhronosGroup/Vulkan-Headers, LICENSE.md). Both texts
are beside this file.

To update them, copy the same files from a newer Vulkan-Headers release
(include/vulkan and include/vk_video).
